WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:11.000
Was bedeutete es für den Alltag vor dem 7. Oktober, in unmittelbarer Nähe zu Gaza und unter einer dauerhaften Sicherheitsbedrohung leben?

00:14.233 --> 00:15.833
That's a very important question,

00:15.833 --> 00:17.533
because it makes you understand

00:17.533 --> 00:19.466
why there is such a huge gap

00:19.466 --> 00:21.366
between the number of casualties here,

00:21.366 --> 00:23.600
and the other side, that's one of the reason.

00:24.333 --> 00:25.866
Firstly...

00:25.866 --> 00:27.766
my government takes care of me.

00:28.466 --> 00:31.033
If you walk around the kibbutz,

00:31.433 --> 00:36.366
you will see, every house has a bomb shelter,

00:36.466 --> 00:39.600
as one of the bedrooms is a bomb shelter.

00:40.366 --> 00:43.666
I have bomb shelters scattered around the kibbutz,

00:43.766 --> 00:47.233
anywhere, if you look around now,

00:47.233 --> 00:48.566
you will spot a few.

00:49.733 --> 00:51.633
Thirdly...

00:51.633 --> 00:53.866
I get messages straight to my phone.

00:53.866 --> 00:55.566
If the army spots something,

00:55.566 --> 00:57.766
I get messages straight to my phone.

00:58.066 --> 01:01.400
"Take shelter" or "be next to a safe room" or whatever.

01:01.866 --> 01:05.400
So my government does a lot,

01:05.433 --> 01:08.100
not that specific government,

01:08.100 --> 01:10.733
but Israeli governments in general,

01:11.100 --> 01:14.033
as a democratic state should do,

01:14.033 --> 01:15.766
they take care of us,

01:16.133 --> 01:19.200
and they give us the means to protect ourselves.

01:19.333 --> 01:20.300
If you walk around,

01:20.300 --> 01:22.233
if I walked around the kibbutz with you,

01:22.366 --> 01:24.333
I could even show you

01:24.333 --> 01:31.133
the different stages of fortifying

01:32.666 --> 01:35.966
because the threats change and

01:36.733 --> 01:40.066
they became a lot more serious throughout the years,

01:40.166 --> 01:43.133
and as the threat change, also the fortifying changes.

01:50.900 --> 01:52.666
So, that's about living here.

01:52.666 --> 01:54.500
Besides ...

01:54.500 --> 01:56.300
Let's say that I don’t live in this place,

01:56.300 --> 01:59.433
and I go to live in Jerusalem or Tel Aviv,

01:59.433 --> 02:01.633
or any other place in Israel,

02:05.500 --> 02:08.533
You have people coming with knives

02:08.533 --> 02:11.400
to make terror attacks, you have bombs,

02:11.433 --> 02:15.233
you have guns, you have trucks

02:15.233 --> 02:18.866
driving into crowds, you have...

02:19.133 --> 02:21.466
booby trap balloons that come over,

02:21.466 --> 02:23.333
Burning kites,

02:23.333 --> 02:27.333
to burn the wheat that we very hard...

02:27.333 --> 02:30.233
worked for.

02:33.700 --> 02:34.733
Looking at this,

02:34.733 --> 02:37.666
you can understand why the border is closed

02:37.666 --> 02:40.233
from the Israeli side and from the Egyptian side.

02:40.433 --> 02:40.900
Because

02:40.900 --> 02:44.033
if everything you’re capable of doing is killing,

02:44.033 --> 02:45.900
stealing,

02:45.900 --> 02:49.033
and burning in your neighbor's land,

02:49.033 --> 02:51.566
nobody wants to have anything to do with you.

02:51.566 --> 02:53.633
Nobody wants anything to do with you.

02:57.133 --> 02:59.033
That is unbelievable to see.

03:01.133 --> 03:05.366
As I said I come from the left of the politics,

03:07.466 --> 03:10.466
I've always cared a lot about

03:10.466 --> 03:12.166
the people on the other side.

03:12.900 --> 03:14.400
I still do.

03:14.900 --> 03:15.966
I'm not stupid enough

03:15.966 --> 03:17.100
to think that 2 million people were

03:17.100 --> 03:19.433
all created the same and they all want to kill me.

03:20.533 --> 03:22.266
But we have a serious problem here,

03:22.266 --> 03:24.266
because when you have a ruler...

03:28.366 --> 03:29.933
Two examples:

03:30.566 --> 03:31.666
You have a ruler,

03:31.666 --> 03:34.333
you’re saying that you’re ruling a starving population.

03:36.066 --> 03:40.400
In 2005, when Israel withdrew from the Gaza Strip.

03:40.633 --> 03:42.800
Israel left...

03:43.133 --> 03:47.633
Greenhouses abundant with fruit and vegetables.

03:48.233 --> 03:51.266
What they did the second that Israel went out?

03:51.733 --> 03:52.933
and they left it for them,

03:52.933 --> 03:55.600
it was a flourishing market.

03:58.700 --> 04:00.266
The second that Israel left,

04:00.266 --> 04:01.800
they came with bats,

04:01.900 --> 04:04.266
and they smashed the entire thing down.

04:04.933 --> 04:08.500
That's the first example that shook my world,

04:08.500 --> 04:11.966
the picture of that was like "what?".

04:12.033 --> 04:15.600
Let's say somebody came here and occupied my people,

04:15.633 --> 04:17.533
and then when they left,

04:17.633 --> 04:19.733
they left us a huge pile of gold,

04:19.733 --> 04:20.666
and we just

04:20.666 --> 04:22.933
decide to take it and throw it into the ocean.

04:24.133 --> 04:26.633
The second thing were the terror attack tunnels.

04:27.133 --> 04:30.733
When I saw the size of the tunnels,

04:31.033 --> 04:33.500
when I saw how much money,

04:33.766 --> 04:38.066
and how many resources were spent to do that

04:38.066 --> 04:39.366
in order, again,

04:39.366 --> 04:41.600
to kill and steal in the neighboring countries.

04:41.766 --> 04:43.166
so I'm asking...

04:45.666 --> 04:47.666
I have a very humanitarian heart,

04:47.833 --> 04:51.333
and my first thoughts about the tunnels were,

04:51.333 --> 04:55.033
before 2014, were "Okay. they're poor people",

04:55.066 --> 04:57.900
"they probably need aid and they probably need"

04:58.133 --> 05:01.166
"medications so they have their tunnels."

05:01.366 --> 05:06.133
That was my excuse for it. and then after those

05:06.133 --> 05:08.100
deadly attacks that happened

05:08.100 --> 05:10.200
both in Egypt and in Israel,

05:11.866 --> 05:14.366
way before October 7,

05:15.700 --> 05:18.633
I looked at this and I said okay,

05:18.633 --> 05:20.533
"I also have a brain", haha,

05:20.733 --> 05:23.133
and this brain has some questions,

05:23.666 --> 05:27.300
because I figured out how much money,

05:27.300 --> 05:30.766
I found it out, how much money it costs to build it,

05:30.866 --> 05:33.433
and I'm saying "what the hell".

05:34.166 --> 05:36.133
What are you talking about?

05:36.766 --> 05:38.466
Why aren't you building...

05:42.633 --> 05:44.466
Why aren't you building dairy farms,

05:44.666 --> 05:48.300
and henneries and schools and hospitals?

05:48.300 --> 05:50.200
Why aren't you planting crops?

05:51.100 --> 05:53.766
All you can do is burn the crops of your neighbors,

05:53.766 --> 05:55.866
with those burning kites.

05:57.433 --> 05:59.933
That's all you do? We sit on the same land.

06:00.300 --> 06:03.433
How come we make agriculture and you’re not,

06:03.966 --> 06:06.266
not on the same level.

06:08.966 --> 06:11.333
And, I'm sorry to tell you,

06:11.333 --> 06:16.066
but when you choose destruction over construction

06:16.066 --> 06:18.366
over and over again

06:18.366 --> 06:20.733
you will probably not be

06:20.733 --> 06:23.800
the most flourishing nation on planet earth.

06:24.100 --> 06:27.000
What can you do, this is how life works.

06:27.900 --> 06:31.066
I don’t know.

06:32.533 --> 06:34.166
What are you doing?

06:35.533 --> 06:38.066
You have a starving population? Feed them.

06:39.366 --> 06:42.166
You’re getting so much aid? Feed them.

06:44.733 --> 06:46.466
But, again

06:46.466 --> 06:46.900
It’s a lie,

06:46.900 --> 06:49.266
because the population in Gaza is not starving,

06:49.300 --> 06:51.233
never have been starving.

06:51.733 --> 06:55.333
But if a ruler claims something like that,

06:55.566 --> 07:00.966
his actions should fit the narrative he's trying to...

07:02.266 --> 07:04.900
I always hear the

07:04.900 --> 07:07.866
spokespeople for Hamas say "what could we have done?".

07:07.866 --> 07:09.966
"What could we have done?" Very simple:

07:09.966 --> 07:12.133
You could have acknowledged the fact that

07:12.133 --> 07:13.966
there's the state of Israel and that

07:13.966 --> 07:17.833
minorities in the Middle East are allowed to rule

07:17.833 --> 07:19.733
a tiny piece of land.

07:20.366 --> 07:22.933
That's very easy what you could have done.
